    "millsfield:images_texts": [
      "BRANIFF INTERNATIONAL\nU.S. MAINLAND HAWAII MEHICO SOUTH AMERICA\nYou'll like flying\n.......\n• 0.\nBraniff Style.\nBI\nFall/ Winter 1971",
      "Going your way. Braniff non-stops\nfrom Dallas/ Fort Worth to all\nthree New York airports.\nLa Guardia.\nKennedy.\nNewark.\nBraniff also offers you non-stops to Dallas/Fort Worth from all three. Both Ways. Every Day.\nAnd two of our non-stops from the New York City area connect perfectly with \"747 Braniff Place\" for\nthe great exception in air travel to Hawaii. Pick your airport, pick your time and call your Travel Agent\nor Braniff: New York 687-8200; Newark 621-6411; Dallas 357-9511; Fort Worth 335-5811.\n200l5\n10\n38",
      "Certificated Services\nRoute Map\natle/Tacoma\n•Portland\n• San Francisco/Oakland\nLos Angeles\nMinneapolis/St Paul\nDes Moines\nChicago\nDenver\nOmaha ea\nKansas City o\nSt. Louis.\ncolorado Springs\nWichita\nOklahoma Ve Tulsa.\nAmarillo\nCity\n1 Nashville\nMemphis.\nFort\nLittle Rock\n• Atlanta\nLubbock\n•Smith e\n1 Shreveport\nDallas/Fort Worth.\nAustin?\nSan Antonio\nHouston-\norpus Chi\nlew York/Newark\nAlami/Fort Lauderda\nMexico City\nAcapulco\nTo Honolulu • To Hilo\n3 Medelin\nBogotal\nCali\nQuito.\nGuayaquil\nLa Paz\n• Cochabamba\nBRANIFF INTERNATIONAL\nU.S: MAINLAND HAWAII MEXICO SOUTH AMERICA\nI Antofagasta\nAsuncion\n• Cordoba\n| Valparaiso\nSantiago\nRosario\nMontevideo\nConcepcion\nBuenos Aires\n• Brasilia\nI Belo Horizonte\nRio de Janeiro\nSao Paulo\n• Porto Alegre"
    ],
